                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d732f871-ccbe-3f14-85e0-00625ff5438e",
                        "entry_id": "f98f5ff2-4cd7-3445-927f-ab3750121be6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "ирон., неодобр. какое-либо направление или какая-либо доктрина в искусстве, философии, идеологии, науке и т. п., обозначаемые термином с суффиксом -изм"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "обычно мн. ч.",
                            "часто"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b5f507bb-8e1f-4485-9765-7617b01f5d40",
                                "sense_id": "d732f871-ccbe-3f14-85e0-00625ff5438e",
                                "text": "Все эти реализмы, идеализмы и прочие измы ужасно захватаны и сплошь и рядом люди, о них препирающиеся, разумеют под ними совсем разные вещи."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cbbed8f6-3cac-43d7-8464-931362f4a989",
                                "sense_id": "d732f871-ccbe-3f14-85e0-00625ff5438e",
                                "text": "Особенно хороши были последние — в миру, так сказать, когда они несли такую чепуху атеизма, нигилизма и всякого другого пресловутого изма, что волоса подымались как у слушателей, так и у них самих."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6330cc35-1cb5-4b06-9976-88dea0a9fe90",
                                "sense_id": "d732f871-ccbe-3f14-85e0-00625ff5438e",
                                "text": "Это относится к реализму, декадансу, символизму, модернизму, постмодерну. К любому «изму» и любому жанру, к любому времени и политическому строю."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "056e1b60-3312-4abc-ab2c-f5541faebf5c",
                                "sense_id": "d732f871-ccbe-3f14-85e0-00625ff5438e",
                                "text": "Как изменился словарь: из узенького, специфически профессионального, изобилующего «измами», звуковой какофонией, превращался он в общерусский: общерусский располагает неисчерпаемым словесным запасом."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7ca43cc4-5b93-4505-a373-2d2811f3b591",
                        "source_entry_id": "f98f5ff2-4cd7-3445-927f-ab3750121be6",
                        "source_sense_id": "d732f871-ccbe-3f14-85e0-00625ff5438e",
                        "target_lang_word": "ism",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ism",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4b3d476d-20b0-30cd-af79-05731432ab77",
                                        "entry_id": "3f7c13ef-c4a2-3d10-bcd5-2e9f301a047d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An ideology, system of thought, or practice that can be described by a word ending in -ism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fbba3255-95f6-4604-91ed-60ab54c59e86",
                                                "sense_id": "4b3d476d-20b0-30cd-af79-05731432ab77",
                                                "text": "[…] his religion, his worship was like his daily bread to him; — which he did not take the trouble to talk much about; which he merely ate at stated intervals, and lived and did his work upon! This is Abbot Samson’s Catholicism of the Twelfth Century; — something like the Ism of all true men in all true centuries, I fancy! Alas, compared with any of the Isms current in these poor days, what a thing!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44d175d0-53b1-4b87-9ffa-9e7e7332d535",
                                                "sense_id": "4b3d476d-20b0-30cd-af79-05731432ab77",
                                                "text": "If it gives way to sentimentalism, or sensibility, or political mysticism, or adopts an affectation of radicalism, or any other ism, or molds its institutions so as to round out to a more complete fulfillment somebody's theory of the universe, it may fall into an era of revolution and political insecurity […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "59ea6902-fcc4-446d-b514-6444d18258a7",
                                                "sense_id": "4b3d476d-20b0-30cd-af79-05731432ab77",
                                                "text": "An ism does not have to possess the fearful implements of state power to cut off a deviant or heretical member."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80f0c6b9-fb7a-4240-ab1a-178b41a3d075",
                                                "sense_id": "4b3d476d-20b0-30cd-af79-05731432ab77",
                                                "text": "In his exposition, he has failed to achieve the identification of situation, theory, and policy necessary to create an ism."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8547e367-950a-42b9-866d-a33b17549a89",
                                                "sense_id": "4b3d476d-20b0-30cd-af79-05731432ab77",
                                                "text": "Isms in my opinion are not good. A person should not believe in an ism – he should believe in himself."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "803576d5-a0c7-4b60-80df-f519659eef3d",
                                                "sense_id": "4b3d476d-20b0-30cd-af79-05731432ab77",
                                                "text": "It is important to distinguish between an ism and a mere generalization about group differences. Generalizations that have statistical validity are not isms. An ism assumes that the generalization applies to an individual."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5d597001-ef70-32f5-83b1-62b882a499b0",
                                        "entry_id": "3f7c13ef-c4a2-3d10-bcd5-2e9f301a047d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An ideology, system of thought, or practice that can be described by a word ending in -ism.",
                                            "A form of discrimination, such as racism or sexism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0380520-f55c-4e04-b7e8-f691508cc1d7",
                                                "sense_id": "5d597001-ef70-32f5-83b1-62b882a499b0",
                                                "text": "Parents and educators play a critical role in helping children of all ages navigate current events and talk openly about the historical roots of the various ‘isms in our country."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5b0e13d3-baa7-482a-a289-e222097155a4",
                        "source_entry_id": "f98f5ff2-4cd7-3445-927f-ab3750121be6",
